# Tier 1 (EUR only): main menu -> PLAY TRAILER -> DEMO.STR plays -> START
# skips it -> back to the title.  The only route through fmvad.cpp,
# FMV_DEMO and the six-entry FILEPOS_MAX, none of which USA compiles in.
# Everything happens inside FrontEnd#1 (the advert is a frontend mode, not
# a scene), so the oracle is the distinct-frame floor plus the usual tags.
# territory EUR
# exit-after 2000
# min-frames 400
# max peak_ram=1400000
# max peak_prim=65536
# max peak_memnodes=64
# expect FrontEnd
# Boot: START alone skips the Nick logo, the three FMVs and PRESS START
# (all done by ~vblank 200 with instant loads), and is inert on the main
# menu (buttons select on CROSS only), so the train can overshoot safely.
# Never START|CROSS here: CROSS on the menu starts a game.
FrontEnd#1+20:0800
